# Removing the SDK

The language generator packs no longer depend on `@deterministic-code/generator-sdk` or the vendored `src/sdk/` copy of it. That SDK is being deleted.

When changing a generator:

- Do not import from `@deterministic-code/generator-sdk` or `./sdk/` (`src/sdk/**`).
- Inline or relocate only what that generator actually uses into pack-owned modules (`src/` next to the generator, not under `src/sdk/`).
- Do not add new files under `src/sdk/`.
- Fix one generator at a time. Goal for each file: **zero SDK imports**.
- Start with `generate-backend-app`, then the rest of the `generate-*.ts` / equivalent entrypoints.
